VERSION 2
RULE injection.interprocedural-command VERSION 1
IN PROJECT
LET input BE VARIABLE MATCHES input.untrusted
LET sink BE CALL MATCHES command.execution
WHEN input FLOWS TO sink
REQUIRE interprocedural.path input
REQUIRE NOT sanitizer.command-approved input
REPORT "OS Command Injection Review"
SEVERITY CRITICAL
CONFIDENCE FROM EVIDENCE
WITH TRACE
